@startuml
actor Client
participant "Controller" as Controller
participant "GetNewsUseCase" as UseCase
participant "NewsRepository" as Repository
participant "NewsLocalDatasource" as Datasource
entity "NewsDatabaseEntity" as Database

Client-> Controller : call api get news list
note right Client
HttpMethod: GET
Path: /api/v1/news
Request Param:
+ page: int
+ size: int
+ status: int (default = 1)
+ sort: created_at:asc,last_updated_at: desc
end note
activate Controller

Controller -> UseCase : call function invoke()
activate UseCase

UseCase -> Repository : call function getNewsList()
activate Repository

Repository -> Datasource : call
Datasource -> Database: call function get data by filter
note over Database
requestParam:
+ page
+ size
+ status
+ sort by
end note
Database -> Database: query to get data
Database --> Datasource : return data

Datasource --> Repository : return databaseEntity
Repository -> Repository: convert databaseEntity to entity
Repository --> UseCase: return entity
UseCase-> UseCase: convert entity into response

deactivate Repository

UseCase --> Controller : return response
deactivate UseCase

Controller --> Client: Response 200 OK
note left Controller
Body{
